As with *f. education* (for which see the previous article), *f. suffrage* is the short for the suffrage of (of course, human) f. creatures, i.e. women.
>>>

<<<
it will be called the female vote & not the woman vote, just as its counterpart will certainly be the male vote & not the man vote; to turn woman into an adjective with female ready made is mere perversity.
===
